you can mitigate some of that

00:06:28.000 --> 00:06:33.199 align:start position:19%
by carefully selecting the plates and
paying attention to

00:06:31.440 --> 00:06:37.759 align:start position:19%
how your body is feeling which you will
have a grasp of

00:06:35.039 --> 00:06:40.720 align:start position:19%
over the years lastly for all my guys
who love

00:06:38.319 --> 00:06:42.880 align:start position:19%
